  "body": "Fixes #7077 (item 4 of 4).\n\nDrew ruling 2026-11-07: a PR is held/special ONLY when explicitly labeled (`held`, `user/owned`, `do-not-merge`, `do-not-auto-edit`); dezren39 authorship never marks a PR held.\n\nChanges (queue task 14120):\n- `scripts/program_tending.py` docstring: 7-day check-in rule now keys on the `user/owned` label instead of \"Drew's own feature PRs\"; hold definition stated as labels-only. HARD_STOPS tuple was already label-based, unchanged.\n- `.github/workflows/program-tending.yml` header comment: same rule restated (comment-only, no behavior change).\n\nTests (oracle: scaffold stays read-only, all five sections report no-action, hard-stop labels named in log):\n- `python3 -I -m unittest discover -s scripts/tests -p 'test_program_tending.py'` — 11 passed locally; same suite runs in CI via the workflow's contract-test step.\n\nOut of scope: archival design docs under doc/ (per issue), queue-worker runbooks (already amended 2026-11-07), cron definitions (separate hatch-personal PR).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796801070&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8002&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8002&signature=f8319d97b30d5b18a2f22685f961808f924b17dad6de9c7f91307d958cf3dc49\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8002?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
